  <h2>How do chiropractors get found in Google and AI search?</h2>
  <p class="answer-first">
    Chiropractors get found by earning visibility in two parallel search layers: traditional Google rankings (Google Business Profile map packs, local organic listings) and generative AI answer engines (Google AI Overviews, ChatGPT search, Perplexity, and Microsoft Copilot).
  </p>
  <p>
    Both engines pull from the same underlying authority signals: clean technical crawlability, structured data schema, consistent practice citations across local directories, and direct, authoritative answers to high-intent patient questions. When your pages rank in top-tier organic positions, AI engines retrieve your passages, synthesize answers, and cite your practice as the source.
  </p>

  <h2>What is AI search optimization (AEO) for chiropractors?</h2>
  <p class="answer-first">
    AI search optimization (also known as Answer Engine Optimization or AEO) is the practice of engineering website content so AI assistants quote and recommend your practice when prospects ask questions about chiropractic care in your market.
  </p>
  <p>
    Unlike traditional keyword stuffing or generic agency blogging, AEO requires chunk-level answer capsules (40-70 word direct answers under explicit question headings), complete JSON-LD Organization and FAQ schema, crawlable static HTML, and machine-readable llms.txt definitions. ChiroCandy builds modern chiropractic SEO campaigns to win both traditional SERP real estate and AI assistant citations simultaneously.
  </p>

